          "text": "Doctor S, \n\nFor the last few days i've experienced a shortness of breath along with runny nose and a bad cough. I am also wheezing a bit.  I'm not sure if it will go away with some home remedies but I keep geting into a bad cough which leads me to lose my breath, then I have to sit and go to a cool room to cool off and catch my breath, practically gasping for breath until it calms and then I resume my normal activities. I know I am scheduled to come in next thursday but I am wondering if you could find time to see me today?",
