          "sent_at": "2025-04-16T17:35:17",
          "text": "Dr. K, \n\nI know a lot of people around here have the flu right now but thankfully I've avoided it. However, I have seem to have caught a really nasty cough. Sometimes if I take a breath that is too deep itll make me cough uncontrollably for almost ten minutes straight and I'll be gasping for breath. It's kind of scary honestly. Mucus does come up sometimes when I cough and my nose is stopped up a little, but this cough is the worst I've ever had and I want to know if I should get it checked out.\n\nThanks",
          "expected": {
            "triage": "EMERGENT",
            "level": 1,
            "relevancy": 10
          }
        }
      ]
